//! The version of LosOS that this build is.
//!
//! The body is generated by `backend/build.rs` (it reads the tag out of
//! `nix/version.nix`, the release CI's file, or takes `LOSOS_VERSION` from
//! the environment — see build.rs for the order). Nothing here is written by
//! hand: the constant exists so the tag the repo is lands in the binaries at
//! compile time, the way boot menus and os-release already say it.

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/version.rs"));
